"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"broadcast","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/throttle\/broadcast()","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}